{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39328","headline":"病中闻相府夜宴戏赠集贤卢学士 · 韦庄","name":"病中闻相府夜宴戏赠集贤卢学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满筵红蜡照香钿，一夜歌钟欲沸天。\n花里乱飞金错落，月中争认绣连乾。\n尊前莫话诗三百，醉後宁辞酒十千。\n无那两三新进士，风流长得饮徒怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}